<title>UK: Airtours up as BZW upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Airtours up as BZW upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Airtours Plc rose on Monday as analysts at BZW raised the stock to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; and said they expected to raise earnings forecasts after first-half results on May 14, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 9p at 943-1/2 by 1301 GMT.</p>
<p>Dealers noted that BZW said it expected a positive statement on short and medium-term prospects along with Airtours' forthcoming results, though no-one from the brokerage was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
